    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tempered Vitality.</strong> Your body has been through the forge and come out with grain aligned.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Body check</strong> to resist fatigue, disease, poison, and other long-haul hazards (at the GM’s discretion).</li><li>In fiction, you don’t cough much, don’t tire easy, and shrug off workshop fumes other people find unbearable.</li></ul>",
